# API Layer

See `docs/agents/api.md` for full conventions.

- Keep controllers thin — delegate to services/managers
- Always scope by `tenantId` and check permissions
- Use error classes from `src/errors/` and `api-response.js`
- Update OpenAPI YAML in `src/docs/routes/` for endpoint changes
